  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Occupational Health and Safety"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Minor in Occupational Health and Safety will equip students from a variety of academic backgrounds and disciplines with foundational knowledge about occupational health and safety, including how to protect workers from risks and hazards in the workplace. Students will be able to specialize their expertise in pathophysiology or law."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The course electives will allow students to gain more in-depth and specialized knowledge in specific and focused areas of occupational health and safety, such as toxicology, health and safety hazards, occupational hygiene, systems safety and control, ergonomics, risk assessment, disability management and sectoral applications and management."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: School of Occupational and Public Health"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Occupational Health and Safety - all options",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Occupational Health and Safety - all options",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/community/occupational/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Public Health - all options",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Public Health - all options",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/community/publichealth/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required courses (1):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "OHS 508 Occupational Health and Safety",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "OHS 508",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/occupational-health/OHS/508/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus at least one (1) of the following:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "ENH 121 Environmental Health Law",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "ENH 121",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/environmental-health/ENH/121/"
        }
